WEBVTT

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:03.160
And our collective narratives
must contain our individual stories,

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:06.456
the arts,

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:08.680
spiritual reflections,

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.000
literature,

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:16.376
and yes, even drumming.

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.000
(Laughter)

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:23.376
It must be a collective telling,

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:27.816
because individual stories
just create a paradigm

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:31.760
where we are pitting one story
against another story.